  "code" : "public void reverse(Deque<Integer> stack) {\n    if (stack.isEmpty()) {\n        return;\n    }\n    int top = stack.pop();\n    reverse(stack);\n    insertAtBottom(stack, top);\n}\n\nprivate void insertAtBottom(Deque<Integer> stack, int val) {\n    if (stack.isEmpty()) {\n        stack.push(val);\n        return;\n    }\n    int top = stack.pop();\n    insertAtBottom(stack, val);\n    stack.push(top);\n}",
